  "rule": "keep the retained protein chains and the retained peptide unchanged; of the non-polymers keep only (a) components covalently connected to the peptide (struct_conn covale/disulf, or a distance-inferred bond at 1.25 x sum of covalent radii, propagated across a whole branched entity), (b) metals and monatomic ions - one heavy atom whose element is in METALS or is a halide, (c) terminal caps ACE/NH2/FOR/NME/ACY that are covalently attached to a retained polymer; remove every other organic non-polymer including crystallisation additives, buffers, polyatomic oxyanions (SO4, PO4, NO3, SCN, VO4), NH4, UNX/UNL placeholders, glycans, lipids, ligands and curated cofactors; curated cofactors are additionally written to complex_cofactors.cif",
